{
  "total": 304,
  "totalPage": 7,
  "page": 2,
  "pageSize": 50,
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2e7",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 199,
      "bookHadithIndex": 51,
      "text": "Ziyad bin Al-Harith As-Suda'i narrated:\"Allah's Messenger ordered me to call the Adhan for the Fajr prayer. I called the Adhan, then Bilal wanted to call the lqamah. Allah's Messenger said: 'Indeed the brother from Suda' has called the Adhan, and whoever calls the Adhan he calls the Iqamah",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-199-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-199-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-199-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-199-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2e8",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 200,
      "bookHadithIndex": 52,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"None should call the Adhan except for one with Wudu",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-200-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-200-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-200-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2e9",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 201,
      "bookHadithIndex": 53,
      "text": "Ibn Shihab narrated that :Abu Hurairah said: \"None should call (for the prayer except for one with Wudu)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-201-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-201-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-201-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2ea",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 202,
      "bookHadithIndex": 54,
      "text": "Jabir bin Samurah narrated:The Mu'adh-dhin of Allah's Messenger would wait and he would not call the Iqamah until he saw the Allah's Messenger had come out, he would call the Iqamah when he saw him",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-202-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-202-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-202-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-202-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2eb",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 203,
      "bookHadithIndex": 55,
      "text": "Salim narrated from his father (Ibn Umar) that :the Prophet said: \"Indeed Bilal calls the Adhan in the night, so eat and drink until you hear the Adhan of Ibn Umm Maktum",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-203-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-203-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-203-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-203-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2ec",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 204,
      "bookHadithIndex": 56,
      "text": "Abu Ash-Sha'tha said:\"A man exited the Masjid after the Adhan for Asr had been called. So Abu Hurairah said: 'As for this person, he has indeed disobeyed Abul Qasim",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-204-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-204-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-204-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-204-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2ed",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 205,
      "bookHadithIndex": 57,
      "text": "Malik bin Al-Huwairih said:\"A cousin of mine and I arrived as guests of Allah's Messenger. He said to us: 'When you travel then call the Adhan and Iqamah and let the eldest of you lead the prayer",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-205-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-205-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-205-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-205-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2ee",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 206,
      "bookHadithIndex": 58,
      "text": "Ibn Abbas narrated:\"The Prophet said: 'Whoever calls the Adhan for seven years, seeking reward for it, salvation from the Fire is written for him",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-206-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-206-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-206-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-206-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2ef",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 207,
      "bookHadithIndex": 59,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"The Imam is answerable and the Mu'adh-dhin is entrusted. O Allah! Guide the Imams and pardon the Mu'adh-dhins",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-207-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-207-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-207-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2f0",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 208,
      "bookHadithIndex": 60,
      "text": "Abu Sa'eed narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"Whenyou hear the call (to prayer) then say the similar to what the Mu'adh-dhin says",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-208-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-208-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-208-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-208-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2f1",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 209,
      "bookHadithIndex": 61,
      "text": "Uthman bin Abi Al-As narrated:\"Indeed, amount the last (of orders) Allah's Messenger ordered me with was to employ a Mu'adh-dhin who would not take a wage for his Adhan",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-209-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-209-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-209-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2f2",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 210,
      "bookHadithIndex": 62,
      "text": "Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"Whoever says, when he hears the Mu'adh-dhin: (Wa Ana Ashadu An La Ilaha Illallah, Wahdahu La Sharika Lahu, Wa Anna Muhammadan Abduhu Wa Rasuluhu, Radittu Billahi Rabban Wa Bil-Islam Dinan, Wa Bi Muhammadin Rasulan) 'I too testify that none has the right to be worshiped but Allah, Alone without partners, and that Muhammad is His slave and Messenger, I am pleased with Allah as my Lord, with Islam as my religion and Muhammad as a Messenger.' - Allah will pardon his sins for him",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-210-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-210-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-210-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-210-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2f3",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 211,
      "bookHadithIndex": 63,
      "text": "Jabir bin Abdullah narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"Whoever says, when he hears the call: (Allahumma, rabba hadhihidda 'watit-tammati was Salatilqa'imah, ati Muhammadanil wasilata wal-Fadilata, wab'athhu Maqamun Mahmudan alladhi wa'adtahu) 'O Allah! Lord of this perfect call and established prayer, grant Muhammad Al-Wasilah and Al-Fadilah, and raise him to the praised station that you promised him' - then intercession on the Day of Resurrection is made lawful for him",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-211-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-211-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-211-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2f4",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 212,
      "bookHadithIndex": 64,
      "text": "Anas bin Malik narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"The supplication made between the Adhan and Iqamah is not rejected",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-212-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-212-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-212-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2f5",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 213,
      "bookHadithIndex": 65,
      "text": "Anas bin Malik narrated:\"On the Night of Isra, fifty prayers were made obligatory upon the Prophet. Then it was decreased until it was made five. Then it was called out: 'O Muhammad! Indeed My Word does not change; these five prayers will be recorded for you as fifty",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-213-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-213-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-213-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-213-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2f6",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 214,
      "bookHadithIndex": 66,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"The five prayers, and Al-Jumuah (the Friday prayer) to Al-Jumuah are atonement for what is between them, as long as the major sins have not been committed",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-214-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-214-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-214-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-214-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Bukhari And Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2f7",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 215,
      "bookHadithIndex": 67,
      "text": "Ibn Umar narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"Salat in congregation is twenty-seven degrees more virtuous than a man's Salat alone",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-215-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-215-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-215-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-215-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2f8",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 216,
      "bookHadithIndex": 68,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"Indeed a man's Salat in the congregation is increased by twenty five rewards over his Salat alone",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-216-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-216-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-216-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-216-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2f9",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 217,
      "bookHadithIndex": 69,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that :the Prophet said: \"I was about to order my boys to collect bundles of firewood, then order Salat to be held, then burn (the homes) of the people who did not attend the Salat",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-217-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-217-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-217-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-217-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2fa",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 218,
      "bookHadithIndex": 70,
      "text": "Mujahid said:\"Ibn Abbas was asked about a man who fasted during the day and stood (in prayers) during the night, but he did not attend the Friday prayer nor congregational prayer. He replied: 'He is in the Fire",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-218-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-218-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-218-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2fb",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 219,
      "bookHadithIndex": 71,
      "text": "Jabir hin Yazid hin Al-Aswad [Al-Amir] narrated that his father said:\"I attended Hajj with the Prophet. I prayed the Subh (Fajr) prayer with him in Masjid AI-Khaif.\" He said: \"When the Prophet finished, he turned (from the Qiblah) and saw two men at the back of the people who had not prayed with him. He said, 'Bring them to me.' So I brought then while they were shuddering with fear. He said: 'What prevented you from praying with us?\" They said: 'O Messenger of Allah!' We prayed at our camp.' So he said: 'Do not do that; when you pray in your camp then you come to a Masjid with a congregation, then pray with them. That will be a voluntary prayer for you",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-219-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-219-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-219-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-219-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2fc",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 220,
      "bookHadithIndex": 72,
      "text": "Abu Sa'eed narrated:\"A man came when Allah's Messenger had already prayed, so he said: 'Which of you will give some reward to this person?' So a man stood to pray with him",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-220-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-220-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-220-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2fd",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 221,
      "bookHadithIndex": 73,
      "text": "Uthman bin Affan narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"Whoever attends Isha (prayer) in congregation, then he has (the reward as if he had) stood half of the night. And whoever prays Isha and Fajr in congregation, then he has (the reward as if he had) spend the entire night standing (in prayer)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-221-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-221-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-221-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-221-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Bukhari And Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2fe",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 222,
      "bookHadithIndex": 74,
      "text": "Jundub bin Sufyan narrated that :the Prophet said: \"Whoever prays the Subh then he is under the protection of Allah's covenant, so do not be treacherous with Allah in his covenant",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-222-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-222-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-222-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b2ff",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 223,
      "bookHadithIndex": 75,
      "text": "Buraidah Al-Aslami narrated that :the Prophet said: \"Give glad tiding to those who walk to the Masajid in the dark; of a complete light on the Day of Resurrection",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-223-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-223-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-223-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b300",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 224,
      "bookHadithIndex": 76,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"The best rows for the men are the first of them, and the worst are the last of them. And the best rows for the women are the last of them, and the worst are the first of them",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-224-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-224-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-224-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-224-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b301",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 225,
      "bookHadithIndex": 77,
      "text": "Narrator not mentioned:And the Prophet said: \"If the people knew what (reward) is in the call (Adhan) and the first row, and they found no other way to get that except drawing lots, then they would draw lots",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-225-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-225-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-225-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b302",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 226,
      "bookHadithIndex": 78,
      "text": "Narrator not mentioned:A Similar narration",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-226-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b303",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 227,
      "bookHadithIndex": 79,
      "text": "An-Nu'man bin Bashir said:\"Allah's Messenger would straighten our lines. One day he came out and saw a man whose chest was protruding from the people, so he said: 'You must straighten your lines, or Allah will cause disagreement to occur among your faces",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-227-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-227-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-227-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-227-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b304",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 228,
      "bookHadithIndex": 80,
      "text": "Abdullah (Ibn Masud) narrated that :the Prophet said: \"Let those among you with understanding and reason be close to me, then those after them, then those after them. And do not separate or dissention will occur among your hearts, and beware of the commotion of the markets",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-228-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-228-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-228-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b305",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 229,
      "bookHadithIndex": 81,
      "text": "Abdul-Hamid bin Mahmud said:\"We prayed behind one of the Amirs, the people compelled us such that we prayed between two columns. When we had prayed, Anas bin Malik said: 'We would be prevented from this during the time of Allah's Messenger",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-229-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-229-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-229-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b306",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 230,
      "bookHadithIndex": 82,
      "text": "Hilal bin Yasar said:\"Ziyad bin Abi Al-Ja'd took me by the hand while we were in Ar Raqqah, he made me stand before a Shaikh who was called Wabisah bin Ma'bad, from Bani Asad. Ziyad said: 'This Shaikh narrated to me that a prayed alone behind the row' - and the Shaikh was listening - 'so Allah's Messenger ordered him to repeat the Salat",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-230-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-230-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-230-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b307",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 231,
      "bookHadithIndex": 83,
      "text": "Wabisah bin Ma'bad narrated:\"A man prayed alone behind the row s the Prophet ordered him to repeat the Salat",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-231-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-231-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-231-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b308",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 232,
      "bookHadithIndex": 84,
      "text": "Ibn Abbas narrated:\"I prayed with the Prophet one night. I stood at his left, so Allah's Messenger took me by my head, from behind me, to put me on his right (side)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-232-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-232-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-232-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-232-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b309",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 233,
      "bookHadithIndex": 85,
      "text": "Samurah bin Jundub narrated:\"Allah's Messenger ordered us that when we were three, then one of us should stand forward",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-233-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-233-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-233-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b30a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 234,
      "bookHadithIndex": 86,
      "text": "Anas bin Malik narrated:\"My grandmother Mutalikah invited Allah's Messenger to a meal that she prepared. He ate from it, then said: 'Stand so tht we may lead you in prayer.'\" He said: \"I got a Hasir of our which had become dark because of prolonged use, so I washed it with water. Allah's Messenger stood on it, and the orphan and I aligned behind him and the only lady stood behind us. He (Allah's Messenger) led us in two Rak'ah of prayer and then left",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-234-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-234-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-234-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-234-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b30b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 235,
      "bookHadithIndex": 87,
      "text": "Abu Mas'ud narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"The one who recites most of the Book of Allah is to lead the people (in prayers). If they are equal in recitation, then the most knowledgeable in the Sunnah among them. If they are equal regarding the Sunnah, then the earliest of them to emigrate. If they are equal in their emigration then the eldest among them. And a man is not to be led in prayer in the place of his authority, and his spot of esteem in his home is not to be sat on without his permission",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-235-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-235-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-235-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Bukhari And Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b30c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 236,
      "bookHadithIndex": 88,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated that :the Prophet said: \"When one of you leads the people in prayer then let him be brief, for indeed here are among them the young and the old, the weak and the ill. When one of you prays alone, then let him pray as he wishes",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-236-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-236-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-236-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-236-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b30d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 237,
      "bookHadithIndex": 89,
      "text": "Anas [bin Malik] narrated:\"Allah's Messenger was among the lightest of people in Salat with its completeness",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-237-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-237-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-237-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-237-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b30e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 238,
      "bookHadithIndex": 90,
      "text": "Abu Sa'eed narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"the key to Salat is the purification, its Tahrim is the Takbir, and its Tahlilis the Taslim, and there is no Salat for one who did not recite Al-Hamd and a Surah in the obligatory (prayer) or other prayers",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-238-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-238-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-238-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b30f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 239,
      "bookHadithIndex": 91,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated:\"When Allah's Messenger performed the Takbir for Salat he would spread his fingers",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-239-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-239-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-239-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b310",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 240,
      "bookHadithIndex": 92,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah narrated:\"When Allah's Messenger would enter the Salat he would raise his hands while they were extended",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-240-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-240-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-240-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b311",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 241,
      "bookHadithIndex": 93,
      "text": "Anas bin Malik narrated that :Allah's Messenger said: \"Whoever performs Salat for Allah for forty days in congregation, catching the first Takbir, two absolutions are written for him: absolution from the Fire, and absolution from the Fire, and absolution from hypocrisy",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-241-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-241-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-241-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b312",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 242,
      "bookHadithIndex": 94,
      "text": "Abu Sa'eeed Al Khudri narrated:\"When Allah;s Messenger stood for Salat during the night, he would say the Takbir (Allahu Akbar), then say: (Subhanaka Allahumma wa bihamdika wa Tabarakasmuka wa Ta'ala Jadduka wa la ilaha ghairuk.) 'Glorious You are O Allah, and with Your praise, and blesses is Your Name, and exalted is Your majesty, and none has the right to be worshipped but You' Then he would say: (A'udhu Bilahi As-Sami'il-Alimi min Ash-Shaitanir-Rajimi, min Hamzihi Wa Nafkhihi wa Nafthihi.)\" 'Allah is undoubtedly the greatest.' (Allahu Akbaru Kabira). Then he would say: 'I seek refuge in Allah the All-Hearing, the All-Knowing, from the cursed Shaitan, from his madness, his arrogance, and his poetry",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-242-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-242-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-242-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b313",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 243,
      "bookHadithIndex": 95,
      "text": "Aishah narrated:\"When the Prophet opened the Salat he would say: (Subhanaka Allahumma wa bihamdika wa tabarakasmuka, wa ta'ala jadduka wa la ilaha ghairuk)\" 'Glorious You are O Allah, and with Your praise, and blessed is Your Name, and exalted is Your majesty, and none has the right to be worshipped but You",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-243-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-243-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-243-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-243-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b314",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 244,
      "bookHadithIndex": 96,
      "text": "Ibn Abdullah bin Mughaffal narrated:\"While I was praying, I said: Bismillahir-Rahmanir-Rahim \"In the Name of Allah, the Merciful, the Beneficent.\" My father heard me and said: \"O my son this is a newly invented matter, beware of the newly-invented.'\" He (Ibn Abdullah) said: \"I have not seen any one of the Companions of Allah's Messenger who hated a newly invented matter in Islam more than him. And he said: 'Ihave performed Salat with the Prophet, and with Abu Bakr, and Umar, and with Uthman. I did not hear any one of them saying it. So do not say it. When you are performing Salat say: Al-Hamdu lilahi Rabbil-Alamin \"All praise is due to Allah the Lord of all that exists",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-244-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-244-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-244-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b315",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 245,
      "bookHadithIndex": 97,
      "text": "Ibn Abbas narrated:\"The Prophet would open his Salat with (Bismillahir-Rahmanir-Rahim)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-245-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-245-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-245-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b316",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 246,
      "bookHadithIndex": 98,
      "text": "Anas narrated:\"Allah's Messenger, Abu Bakr, Umar and Uthman opened the Salat with (Al-Hamdu-lillahi rabbil-alamin)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-246-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-246-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-246-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-246-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b317",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 247,
      "bookHadithIndex": 99,
      "text": "Ubadah bin As-Samil narrated that :the Prophet said: \"There is no Salat for the one who does not recite Fatihatil-Kitab",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-247-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-247-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-247-basharawadmaarouf",
          "name": "Bashar Awad Maarouf",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-247-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c702dd1a4c9c86f0b318",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322",
      "bookIndex": 2,
      "hadithIndex": 248,
      "bookHadithIndex": 100,
      "text": "Wa'il bin Hujr narrated:\"I heard the Prophet recite: (Not (the way) of those who earned Your anger, nor those who went astray) and he said: 'Amin.' And he stretched it out with his voice",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1322-2-248-ahmadmuhammadshakir",
          "name": "Ahmad Muhammad Shakir",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
